# python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
# No trailing slash: `.venv` is a SYMLINK into the store now (built by
# `nix build .#dev-env --out-link .venv`), and `.venv/` matches only directories
# — so the trailing slash left the symlink showing as an untracked file.
.venv
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

# nix
result
result-*

# rust — the cargo workspace's build output. Absent until the D1 workspace
# landed, so 462 MB of clippy incremental caches and rustdoc search indexes
# rode into history before anyone noticed.
target/

# angular frontend
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.angular/

# recall runtime data — NEVER commit audio or transcripts
data/
audio/
logs/
*.wav
*.flac
*.opus
# ...except the clips the tests may actually ship with. A public repo cannot
# carry recordings of real people, but it must carry SOMETHING, or checks that
# read like repo-wide guarantees quietly do nothing on a fresh clone (#1433).
# See tests/fixtures/speech/README.md.
#
# ⚠ These three negations are the WHOLE exception and they are named one by one
# on purpose. A pattern here (`!tests/fixtures/speech/*.flac`) would silently
# adopt whatever lands in that directory next, which is exactly how household
# audio would reach a public repo. Adding a fourth is a decision, not a tidy-up.
!tests/fixtures/speech/public-domain-en.flac
# Synthetic speech: macOS `say` reading INVENTED lines (plants, a plumber, a
# bakery) rendered by the committed scripts/gen-speech-fixture.sh, so they are
# PII-free by construction — nobody's voice, nothing about this household. They
# carry the only Dutch in the gate, and they score 0.0123 / 0.0000 WER against
# exact references where the public-domain reading scores 0.0426, which makes
# them the better drift instrument. Regenerating them in CI is not an option:
# `say` is macOS-only and CI runs Ubuntu, so committing is the only way a clone
# can run the Dutch ASR check and the Dutch VAD test. Committed 2026-09-09 on
# Pippijn's explicit go-ahead, the blunt no-audio rule above being his to waive.
!tests/fixtures/speech/dialogue-en.flac
!tests/fixtures/speech/dialogue-nl.flac
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

# local secrets (e.g. HuggingFace token) — never commit
.env
